(MOVEMENT) Tj T*
(- Queen Bee: moves one space.) Tj T*
(- Beetle: moves one space, and may climb on top of the hive. A piece under a Beetle) Tj T*
(   can not move.) Tj T*
(- Grasshopper: jumps in a straight line over one or more pieces to the first empty) Tj T*
(   space.) Tj T*
(- Spider: moves exactly three spaces around the hive, without going back.) Tj T*
(- Soldier Ant: moves any number of spaces around the hive.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PASSING) Tj T*
(If you can not place or move any piece, you pass. Otherwise you must play.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF THE GAME) Tj T*
(You win when your opponent's Queen Bee is surrounded on all six sides, by pieces of) Tj T*
(any color. If both Queens become surrounded at the same time, the game is a draw.) Tj T*
ET
